        300.0193176269531,
        211.2909698486328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "systems in part hinges on providing rigorous guarantees on",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        213.1931915283203,
        300.0181579589844,
        221.2539825439453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "their performance and safety through a formal veriﬁcation",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        223.15516662597656,
        300.0181579589844,
        231.21595764160156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "method, such as reachability analysis. In this work, we present a",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        233.11817932128906,
        300.0181884765625,
        241.17897033691406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "simple-to-implement, sampling-based algorithm for reachability",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        243.08119201660156,
        300.01806640625,
        251.14198303222656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "analysis that is provably optimal up to any desired approximation",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        253.0431671142578,
        300.0182189941406,
        261.10394287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "accuracy. Our method achieves computational efﬁciency by judi-",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        263.00616455078125,
        300.01812744140625,
        271.06695556640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ciously sampling a ﬁnite subset of the state space and generating",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        272.96917724609375,
        300.01812744140625,
        281.02996826171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "an approximate reachable set by conducting reachability analysis",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        282.9311828613281,
        300.0180969238281,
        290.99200439453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "on this ﬁnite set of states. We prove that the reachable set",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        292.8941955566406,
        300.0181579589844,
        300.95501708984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "generated by our algorithm approximates the ground-truth",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        302.8572082519531,
        300.0181884765625,
        310.91802978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "reachable set for any user-speciﬁed approximation accuracy. As",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        312.8192138671875,
        300.0182189941406,
        320.8800048828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a corollary to our main method, we introduce an asymptotically-",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        322.7822265625,
        300.0181579589844,
        330.843017578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "optimal, anytime algorithm for reachability analysis. We present",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        332.7452392578125,
        300.0180969238281,
        340.8060302734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "simulation results that reafﬁrm the theoretical properties of our",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        342.7072448730469,
        300.0181579589844,
        350.76806640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "algorithm and demonstrate its effectiveness in real-world inspired",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
        352.6702575683594,
        300.0180969238281,
        360.7310791015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scenarios.",
      "bbox": [
        48.95896530151367,
